  "mechanism": "SpikingAssociativePlausibilityOrgan: the co-occurrence graph is installed as directed cortex_A->dlpfc_B synapses (weight \u221d co-occurrence count) on a real SimulationBridge; related(w1,w2) drives w1's assembly and reads whether w2's readout assembly fires above the brain's own threshold (tau_spike = the 50th-percentile rule applied to the brain's positive spiking readouts). The decision reads cp_firing_states, not P>=tau. Monosynaptic (the readout never projects back), so no multi-hop transitive blow-up.",
